Observed on 2026-06-04:

- Discovery route is public-read: no bearer required on `/api/docs` routes.
- Rate limit in discovery response: Upstash, all requests, `1200 / 1 m`.
- Health route reported docs-api status `ok` and Typesense status `200`.
- List docs route reported `found: 660` documents.

Useful route shapes:

```txt
GET /api/docs
GET /api/docs/openapi.json
GET /api/docs/health
GET /api/docs/docs?page=1&perPage=20
